      "Kael looks at the horizon where the light ends. Twelve point one degrees wide. Somewhere past it, the planet is a freezer. Here there is sun and fish and rope and eleven species of very frightened fish and a raised deck he built with his own hands and two daughters who have never known anything else.",
      "\"Long enough,\" he says.",
      "Emiko does not ask again. She is sixteen. She has already learned that the second question is the one that costs."
