      "The facts are these and they are read out of Jin's instrument memory, in order, with timestamps, into a room of eleven people who have spent ten years learning to trust numbers more than voices.",
      "Aperture open. Aperture temperature raises four degrees at 0417 and falls eleven seconds later. Occurring twice daily. Occurring at the same hour. Occurring for ten years.",
      "\"That's an instrument fault,\" says one of the eleven. His name is Bello and he runs the air plant and he is right to ask.",
      "\"It's on a plate,\" Jin says. \"Twelve minutes of it.\"",
