      "The room does the thing rooms do. Bello sits back and lets the argument finish without him, which in the bunker means agreement deferred.",
      "So they frame it carefully, because the alternative to care is a stampede. Maya's motion has four clauses and the fourth is the one that will be remembered: no announcement until the survey team goes back up and comes back down with a second set of readings.",
