      "He leaves the doorway. The room watches him go.",
      "Yorke sits down. Her legs hurt. She looks at the number on her hand, eleven point five, and she understands that it is not a measurement anymore, it is a countdown, and she does not know what it is counting down to, and she does not know if anyone in this room knows either, and she sits very still with her hands folded and waits for someone else to speak.",
