      "We are not the only light.",
      "\"Kael,\" she says. \"Finish the post. Then we go home and tell the council that the dark has neighbours.\"",
      "She looks at the light one more time. It burns. It does not move. It is waiting, the way all lights wait, for someone to come and see what it is shining on."
